                </span>
              ))}
            </div>
          </ChartCard>

          <ChartCard
            title="Mexico H1 rebound path"
            subtitle="Streak-break H1???25 ??? H1???26 +3.1% ??? concentration pressure returning"
          >
            <div className="h-72 w-full min-w-0">
